[{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十八","author":"戴亨","text":"生涯虽淡薄，启处觉徜徉。\n别有荣华境，非关富贵场。\n朱弦流逸韵，湘茝发寒芳。\n相赏尘嚣外，知稀亦不妨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10496,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十九","author":"戴亨","text":"穷途安此日，宦海忆当年。\n容膝论何地，抽簪遂所天。\n藜床穿可坐，锻灶煖堪眠。\n在昔庾开府，深知二子贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10497,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄答边赵珍","author":"戴亨","text":"荆山和氏璧，流水伯牙琴。\n岂不宜高价，其如乏赏音。\n功名陶大块，学业粹分阴。\n不受穷通囿，方知玉汝心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10498,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读道书","author":"戴亨","text":"精纯堪入圣，玄妙亦非狂。\n不坏人间相，兼希物外方。\n道参天地始，心契鬼神藏。\n生死真消息，群言岂尽荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"季春晦日晚步金鱼池得通字","author":"戴亨","text":"鱼沼寻昏黑，崎岖僻径通。\n沾衣垂露草，迎面落花风。\n石髓鸣幽涧，星光炯太空。\n归途增夜寂，清梵出云丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻蛩","author":"戴亨","text":"秋来人不觉，偏尔识凉温。\n清露下庭际，哀音动草根。\n孤踪长冷落，荒径易黄昏。\n微雨兼明月，谁堪永夜喧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日郊宴","author":"戴亨","text":"折简邀同辈，登临破郁陶。\n但知狂纵酒，不敢妄题糕。\n捲地惊沙起，鸣霄旅雁高。\n残阳欹远树，天畔落云涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古庙","author":"戴亨","text":"后起千年树，先来一片山。\n老僧勤导引，颓磴苦跻攀。\n萝薜牵秦月，箴铭勒汉环。\n诸天皆寂灭，何处问无还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过金鱼池 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"暮春偕道侣，春服试初成。\n经雨林花色，衔泥水燕情。\n野风吹面暖，岚气傍衣生。\n浴咏思前哲，遥遥结远盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过金鱼池 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"违俗原无意，馀生自有涯。\n谈经寻僻地，沽酒就晴沙。\n野日迟菱浦，风泉落涧花。\n但教予性适，谁识世情赊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10505,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过金鱼池 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"野酌无专向，幽寻信屐踪。\n沼鱼晴弄影，沙渚细含风。\n虎仆抽新藻，龙兹藉落红。\n萧然濠濮上，胸境一时空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过金鱼池 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"幽思萦新句，奇情恋落晖。\n清风时拂座，空翠偶沾衣。\n疏野真成癖，嬉游未尽非。\n归来天欲暮，乘兴叩僧扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后鱼溪 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"昨苦泥途滑，今来霁景分。\n诗情随笠屐，林壑绝埃氛。\n白石蒸残雨，青天补漏云。\n往还行径熟，鸥鸟久为群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后鱼溪 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"兴来无早暮，放步即邱林。\n拥鼻从人笑，探幽且自吟。\n烟云工变态，鱼鸟识閒心。\n眷恋斜阳下，遥山入望深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后鱼溪 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"万汇晴光里，微躯物色俱。\n澄怀亲水石，观化会虚无。\n绿藻鱼遗子，微风燕引雏。\n真机随处得，相赏有吾徒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后鱼溪 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"沽酒延清赏，攀荆坐绿丛。\n溪云停宿雨，沙鸟落轻风。\n避俗身耽寂，看山兴不穷。\n疏狂成痼癖，此意复谁同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后鱼溪 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"但有开襟处，相将兴不阑。\n路从渔父得，山许野人看。\n素尚虽难遂，幽寻亦自欢。\n乾坤容我放，未肯信衰残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对镜","author":"戴亨","text":"形色根于性，虚明照若神。\n检身惭寡过，觌面不惊人。\n岁月诚难假，须眉到老真。\n遐思姑射子，冰雪貌长春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对镜步张生光模韵","author":"戴亨","text":"皎洁君能守，真常我不如。\n发须将白尽，愿力未酬初。\n深虑精华铄，频惊岁月虚。\n前途难预鉴，相对一长歔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"散步","author":"戴亨","text":"散步开荆户，支颐听鸟音。\n断云侵榻冷，小雨过山阴。\n世事终难测，交情不敢深。\n天留閒岁月，遥寄鹿门心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"廷璋儿以武举效力京营千总秉瑛侄以进士试用户部主事数年资其薄俸以供饘粥今二子前后归班候选生路遂绝赋此见志且励二子固贫之志不可不坚也","author":"戴亨","text":"生机何所赖，官罢废饔飧。\n不有安贫乐，焉知陋巷尊。\n无谋宜困阨，守死报乾坤。\n应笑皋夔侣，饥来叩富门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠金鱼池酒肆主人 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"相逢沽酒肆，混迹亦泉林。\n阅尽尘寰态，无妨栖隐心。\n山光当户列，云色傍檐阴。\n时有观鱼乐，衔杯濠上吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠金鱼池酒肆主人 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"车马纷驰地，唯馀此际閒。\n襟怀耽泌水，阛阓即深山。\n庭敞峰争入，池幽鸟去还。\n应嗤茂陵叟，卖赋向人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过金鱼池酒肆","author":"戴亨","text":"酒肆人间世，幽寻不觉喧。\n千峰奔座榻，一水漱篱根。\n茗椀亲鱼藻，诗情寄鹿门。\n呶呶沈醉客，相顾两无言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿卧佛寺精舍","author":"戴亨","text":"日入众山悄，谷禽时一鸣。\n閒房留半榻，明月上初更。\n云去天无迹，风来树有声。\n根尘何日净，相对说无生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊辰七月六日举子命名廷璧","author":"戴亨","text":"夜乏维熊兆，朝闻异雀鸣。\n果能承父业，敢望大家声。\n白首嗟余老，何时见汝成。\n几篇残著作，辛苦历平生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"久雨忽晴","author":"戴亨","text":"经月苦淋涝，瀰漫天地昏。\n豁然开暮景，相约出衡门。\n碧水沈云色，青山带雨痕。\n高飞看野鹤，去去没遥村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋晓","author":"戴亨","text":"短杖策晨露，高天过塞鸿。\n孤云宿危石，幽草生凉风。\n秋色既如此，暮怀相与同。\n徘徊无尽意，举首望长空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日溪行","author":"戴亨","text":"斜日明村巷，商声动暮蝉。\n一年将欲尽，百岁岂徒然。\n坐起草沙际，夷犹云鸟前。\n愁心无处著，随意此留连。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后看山","author":"戴亨","text":"望久山无色，苍茫立钓矶。\n豁然高壁露，知是薄云归。\n鹅鸭爱新雨，儿童嬉落晖。\n世情难尽遣，聊且学忘机。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀单青侅","author":"戴亨","text":"偶然得聚首，遂尔成知音。\n浊酒冰霜别，故人关塞深。\n东风变芳草，离思结春阴。\n望久无来雁，徒增岑寂心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀杨子安","author":"戴亨","text":"相识未云久，相知觉己深。\n寒风吹别泪，芳树霭新阴。\n漏静发遥思，月明无两心。\n蚕丛西蜀道，魂梦历危岑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李廉衣来京己两月矣遍寻不晤感赋 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"道义偶然合，绸缪遂至今。\n早知松柏性，不畏雪霜侵。\n阔别三年久，相思此日深。\n徽音如在望，跂睇缈云岑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李廉衣来京己两月矣遍寻不晤感赋 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"几度扶筇出，寻君空复还。\n萧斋肠若结，孤榻梦相关。\n梁苑何能到，青云不可攀。\n窗禽春唤侣，终日语绵蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客境","author":"戴亨","text":"客境从飘泊，生涯若有无。\n饥寒持岁月，潦草聚妻孥。\n敢谓人情薄，深惭吾道孤。\n谋生原不易，况是老迂儒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻蝉","author":"戴亨","text":"三伏时方半，炎威势正横。\n哀蝉声忽咽，凉露意潜惊。\n多是穷愁客，易生迟暮情。\n白头孤馆里，偏听尔长鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"壬申正月十一日纪事","author":"戴亨","text":"炊烟断蜗室，惨雪洒鹅毛。\n沟壑安吾分，饥寒愧汝曹。\n衰残难自诿，奔走亦徒劳。\n此境平生惯，高吟且自豪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"任东涧访余仪徵县署留话三日赋赠","author":"戴亨","text":"就养真阳署，深藏异隐沦。\n薄材安腐朽，同气别风尘。\n不患无知己，终愁逊古人。\n逢君旋复去，相送意逡巡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"真州距杭城仅数百里自夏徂秋己历三月不能一省祖墓雨后见月感赋","author":"戴亨","text":"来此夫何事，淹留起暮愁。\n江山邻故国，风雨滞行舟。\n白发心多感，他乡月易秋。\n望云挥老泪，魂梦越江游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题观稼图","author":"戴亨","text":"身膺民社寄，民以食为天。\n命棹随流水，觇农遍野阡。\n沙鸥浮远渚，山雨洒平田。\n岂博循良誉，公私望有年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送金纫芷归全椒即用留别原韵","author":"戴亨","text":"契合原非易，分携倍觉难。\n尊醪残腊候，风雪暮江寒。\n白发诗文约，青灯岁月宽。\n回舟梅正发，相待早春看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游潘园酬沈沃田江松泉","author":"戴亨","text":"园小依城筑，楼高傍水开。\n春晴一登眺，山色渡江来。\n廉使饶清兴，诸君不易才。\n莺花陪胜宴，衰朽愧新裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙亥上巳约署中诸友游吴园雨阻不践","author":"戴亨","text":"客斋逢禊日，相约出尘氛。\n花鸟摧淫雨，林亭阻大云。\n春光聊滞我，高致岂虚君。\n待得新晴后，登临意倍欣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月八日吴园脩禊","author":"戴亨","text":"名园喜初霁，脩禊践幽寻。\n石耸峰峦古，烟生洞壑深。\n和风吹老貌，春水涤烦襟。\n忽忆山阴会，遥遥隔古今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题见山楼","author":"戴亨","text":"缥缈立高楼，新晴豁远眸。\n天垂荒野阔，山夹大江流。\n花鸟三春丽，乾坤一望收。\n苍茫东海外，彷佛见瀛洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚斋坐雨步纫芷原韵","author":"戴亨","text":"时序春光晚，昏埋雨气深。\n水连高岸阔，云涌大江沈。\n岁月淹胥浦，乡关动越吟。\n松楸天际望，展转莫愁侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日游吴园步韵","author":"戴亨","text":"晴色丽朝暾，肩舆出郭门。\n招携酬令节，取次历名园。\n丘壑高人致，烟霞过客魂。\n小山丛桂外，将拟采芳荪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和金仁趾乞任东涧撰大父竹溪先生诗叙原韵","author":"戴亨","text":"大父真人瑞，文孙亦世贤。\n诗歌垂隐德，扬扢赖洪篇。\n艰苦唯斯道，嗟跎及暮年。\n江淹才欲尽，把卷意茫然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙亥生日书怀","author":"戴亨","text":"残年心易足，回首事多惊。\n岁月崎岖过，文章惨淡成。\n湖山新老眼，梅竹遂平生。\n东望钱塘近，扁舟独往情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"戴亨","text":"断却黄金臂，高秋世外悬。\n未参心即佛，先示指头禅。\n接引空垂相，归依待有缘。\n何人求解脱，稽首问真诠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶中红梅","author":"戴亨","text":"青障回残腊，红梅放早芳。\n折来供几席，生意见冰霜。\n貌古非无色，寒深自有香。\n谁于萧索候，相赏弗相忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答东涧老人","author":"戴亨","text":"冰雪双蓬鬓，乾坤两布衣。\n久甘身寂寞，不问世轻肥。\n老益诗情壮，狂憎酒力微。\n百年閒事业，耽此未全非。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"熊某为写小照诗以赠之","author":"戴亨","text":"科头非戾俗，觌面岂惊人。\n顾我才无用，知君笔有神。\n栖崖云自古，采药涧长春。\n他日酬微尚，名山绘始真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丙子二月二十七日自真州赴杭省祖墓","author":"戴亨","text":"辽海归无日，西泠旧有坟。\n青年频入梦，白首但空闻。\n帆挂长江月，心依故国云。\n裹粮酬夙愿，春景正氤氲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓜州渡江","author":"戴亨","text":"瓜步扁舟晓，金山翠霭澄。\n莺花三月渡，风土百年心。\n地势分南北，江流自古今。\n废兴思往迹，感叹一何深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚泊","author":"戴亨","text":"古岸维舟后，清灯对酒时。\n竹深渔唱晚，江迥雁飞迟。\n无计酬黄石，空怀茹紫芝。\n飘零归故国，惭愧老天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月八日桃源岭展祖墓","author":"戴亨","text":"策杖缘湖岸，披荆觅墓门。\n望空三酹酒，剪纸一招魂。\n泪洒流泉溢，悲深野日昏。\n欲回天色暮，惆怅立郊原。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"展墓后述哀","author":"戴亨","text":"艰难依北塞，生死绝南征。\n古冢荒榛合，悲风薄暮生。\n老亲他日泪，游子百年情。\n幸不先朝露，犹来献一觥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月十六日奉窆曾祖母陈太君祖父葭湄公于杭城留下之安乐山","author":"戴亨","text":"开尊浇厚土，卜吉妥幽魂。\n远水潆沙岸，群山拱墓门。\n相形宜震巽，表石示儿孙。\n敢妄希荣显，相期笃本原。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月二十日自杭返仪徵舟中纪行 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"舟行真自在，风顺不稽程。\n天逐江流转，帆随鸟翼轻。\n越山青未断，吴岫远相迎。\n少泊依沙岸，东冈月色明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月二十日自杭返仪徵舟中纪行 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"已解嘉禾缆，兼程一叶轻。\n雨收黄歇浦，帆挂吕蒙城。\n未觉劳行役，閒生吊古情。\n忽闻江上笛，悽切作离声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"京口渡江与金孝廉棕亭同作","author":"戴亨","text":"行李发江东，帆轻御便风。\n几朝同啸咏，千里破空濛。\n天入南徐阔，山经北固雄。\n君才堪利涉，吾道近蓑翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"官斋","author":"戴亨","text":"官斋三载住，公事一无闻。\n就养非高隐，劳生且出群。\n性怜娇女慧，学喜幼儿勤。\n犹子循声著，清贫意颇欣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"维扬远眺","author":"戴亨","text":"邗水云初散，芜城目暂舒。\n江山通楚越，风俗重盐鱼。\n董相崇祠在，昭明旧阁馀。\n古来繁盛地，歌舞近何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同金孝廉钟越游新城汪园五首 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"肩舆出近郭，引缆赴遥岑。\n兴发淩虚棹，心清浴水禽。\n岸沙疏雨润，村路白云深。\n未览林园胜，晴郊已散襟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同金孝廉钟越游新城汪园五首 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"舍舟登彼岸，策杖踏秋原。\n苔滑欹桥路，云生古寺门。\n溪山娱老性，尊斝就名园。\n持此幽偏意，应同静者论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同金孝廉钟越游新城汪园五首 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"入门披竹露，觅胜信芒鞋。\n瑶草潜幽涧，山花坠古厓。\n烟霞如有待，樵牧且相偕。\n眷恋林泉好，经过每畅怀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同金孝廉钟越游新城汪园五首 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"飞阁淩霄起，登临入望宽。\n江声流槛外，山色扑檐端。\n时序清秋晚，风霜白日寒。\n东西连楚越，乘兴一凭栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日同金孝廉钟越游新城汪园五首 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"景物探幽邃，风光解送迎。\n林峦多变态，登眺屡移情。\n南北身无定，欢娱感易生。\n名山何处卜，归老遂躬耕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]